<text><body>
<cb:mulu level="1" type="其他">往生徵信錄下</cb:mulu>
<milestone n="5" unit="juan"/>
<lb n="0701b09" ed="X"/>
<lb n="0701b10" ed="X"/>
<lb n="0701b11" ed="X"/>
<lb n="0701b12" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b01" ed="R110"/><cb:juan n="5" fun="open"><cb:mulu n="5" type="卷"></cb:mulu><cb:jhead>蓮修起信錄卷第五</cb:jhead></cb:juan>
<lb n="0701b13" ed="X"/>
<lb n="0701b14" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b03" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="1" type="其他">華陀大士籤方</cb:mulu><head>華陀大士籤方</head>
<lb n="0701b15" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b04" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0701b1501">爐中却病煉金丹，九九功成火候難。龍虎調勻升降
<lb n="0701b16" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b05" ed="R110"/>合，院中新竹報平安。近來藥籠甚消閒，還把彌陀念
<lb n="0701b17" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b06" ed="R110"/>兩三。妙法回春人不信，空教珠淚落珊珊。吾華陀也。
<lb n="0701b18" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b07" ed="R110"/>吾奉佛勅來壇，判方濟世。呵呵，因緣盛矣。吾今所判
<lb n="0701b19" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b08" ed="R110"/>內外丹方，各四十八籤，合古彌陀四十八願。眾生一
<lb n="0701b20" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b09" ed="R110"/>念<g ref="#CB05418"/>誠，自有感應。</p>
<lb n="0701b21" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b10" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="2" type="其他">內證籤方</cb:mulu><head>內證籤方</head>
<lb n="0701b22" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b11" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第壹籤</cb:mulu><head>第壹籤</head>
<lb n="0701b23" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b12" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0701b2301" type="regular"><l>桑皮貝母用三分，<caesura/>半夏陳皮定要陳，</l>
<lb n="0701b24" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b13" ed="R110"/><l>桔梗二錢糖作引，<caesura/>煎湯服下可回春。</l></lg>
<pb n="0701c" ed="X" xml:id="X62.1204.0701c"/>
<lb n="0701c01" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b14" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0701c0101" style="margin-left:2em">病愈，念佛四萬八千，滿圖壹張，佛前焚化，代念
<lb n="0701c02" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b15" ed="R110"/>亦可。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0701c03" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b16" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳籤</head>
<lb n="0701c04" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b17" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0701c0401" type="regular"><l>茯苓白朮共烏梅，<caesura/>各用三錢若手推，</l>
<lb n="0701c05" ed="X"/><lb n="0452b18" ed="R110"/><l>借問此方何作引，<caesura/>煨薑一片棗三枚。</l></lg>
<lb n="0701c06" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a01" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0701c0601" style="margin-left:2em">請觀音聖號壹千二百聲，閤家代念亦可。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0701c07" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a02" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參籤</cb:mulu><head>第參籤</head>
<lb n="0701c08" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a03" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0701c0801" type="regular"><l>一錢豆豉四分連，<caesura/>香茹柴胡各二錢，</l>
<lb n="0701c09" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a04" ed="R110"/><l><g ref="#CB05418"/>誦大悲水煎服，<caesura/>如方三服保平安。</l></lg>
<lb n="0701c10" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a05" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0701c1001" style="margin-left:2em">臨服時，先請觀音聖號二十一遍。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0701c11" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a06" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆籤</head>
<lb n="0701c12" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a07" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0701c1201" type="regular"><l>延胡索共五加皮，<caesura/>各用三錢病可移，</l>
<lb n="0701c13" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a08" ed="R110"/><l>臨服誠心宣聖號，<caesura/>此方屢試有神奇。</l></lg>
<lb n="0701c14" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a09" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0701c1401" style="margin-left:2em">閤家念十萬佛，二天完竣，來壇焚圖有感。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0701c15" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a10" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第伍籤</cb:mulu><head>第伍籤</head>
<lb n="0701c16" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a11" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0701c1601" type="regular"><l>青皮兩地與茵陳，<caesura/>白芷連翹共苦參，</l>
<lb n="0701c17" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a12" ed="R110"/><l>每服四錢煎五滾，<caesura/>燈心為引效如神。</l>
<lb n="0701c18" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a13" ed="R110"/><l>代念佛圖壹張。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0701c19" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a14" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第陸籤</cb:mulu><head>第陸籤</head>
<lb n="0701c20" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a15" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0701c2001" type="regular"><l>台烏半夏共沉香，<caesura/>各用三分作滾湯，</l>
<lb n="0701c21" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a16" ed="R110"/><l>金橘三枚去核肉，<caesura/>煎湯服下病安康。</l></lg>
<lb n="0701c22" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a17" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0701c2201" style="margin-left:2em">代持解劫呪壹伯零八遍，楊枝水灑病軀。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0701c23" ed="X"/><lb n="0453a18" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第柒籤</cb:mulu><head>第柒籤</head>
<lb n="0701c24" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b01" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0701c2401" type="regular"><l>金銀花酒一方良，<caesura/>加上黃芩製大黃，</l>
<pb n="0702a" ed="X" xml:id="X62.1204.0702a"/>
<lb n="0702a01" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b02" ed="R110"/><l>戌刻無根水煎服，<caesura/>虔喧聖號自安康。</l></lg>
<lb n="0702a02" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b03" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0702a0201" style="margin-left:2em">代放生命壹伯，佛號三萬聲。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0702a03" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b04" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第捌籤</cb:mulu><head>第捌籤</head>
<lb n="0702a04" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b05" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702a0401" type="regular"><l>黨參白朮共黃芪，<caesura/>遠志山萸搗若泥，</l>
<lb n="0702a05" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b06" ed="R110"/><l>猪腎一枚同煎服，<caesura/>分為三次病稱奇。</l></lg>
<lb n="0702a06" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b07" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0702a0601" style="margin-left:2em">代誦大悲呪、解劫呪，各四十八遍。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0702a07" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b08" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第玖籤</cb:mulu><head>第玖籤</head>
<lb n="0702a08" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b09" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702a0801" type="regular"><l>川芎歸尾與紅花，<caesura/>白芷秦芄共木瓜，</l>
<lb n="0702a09" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b10" ed="R110"/><l>每用二錢酒作引，<caesura/>如方煎服自然瘥。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0702a10" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b11" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾籤</head>
<lb n="0702a11" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b12" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702a1101" type="regular"><l>猪芩澤瀉車前子，<caesura/>煎服還加煅鼠矢，</l>
<lb n="0702a12" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b13" ed="R110"/><l>各用三錢薑一片，<caesura/>一服何須再用此。</l></lg>
<lb n="0702a13" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b14" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0702a1301" style="margin-left:2em">諷觀音呪四伯捌拾遍。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0702a14" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b15" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾壹籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾壹籤</head>
<lb n="0702a15" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b16" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702a1501" type="regular"><l>三黃石膏丸一副，<caesura/>白湯水送休恐佈，</l>
<lb n="0702a16" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b17" ed="R110"/><l>若待藥力性到時，<caesura/>病勢霍然自安愈。</l></lg>
<lb n="0702a17" ed="X"/><lb n="0453b18" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0702a1701" style="margin-left:2em">放生百條，持大悲呪二十一遍。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0702a18" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a01" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾貳籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾貳籤</head>
<lb n="0702a19" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a02" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702a1901" type="regular"><l>扁蓄車前共瞿麥，<caesura/>山藥薏仁范志<g ref="#CB01186"/>，</l>
<lb n="0702a20" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a03" ed="R110"/><l>各用三分研細末，<caesura/>糖和服下可安宿。</l></lg>
<lb n="0702a21" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a04" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0702a2101" style="margin-left:2em">持滅罪真言三千遍，放生五百命。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0702a22" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a05" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾參籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾參籤</head>
<lb n="0702a23" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a06" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702a2301" type="regular"><l>蕎麵大黃竝鱉甲，<caesura/>紅花歸尾元胡索，</l>
<lb n="0702a24" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a07" ed="R110"/><l>各用三分服五劑，<caesura/>如方配就休妄錯。</l></lg></cb:div>
<pb n="0702b" ed="X" xml:id="X62.1204.0702b"/>
<lb n="0702b01" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a08" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾肆籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾肆籤</head>
<lb n="0702b02" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a09" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702b0201" type="regular"><l>黑豆三錢棗五枚，<caesura/>白前白芨與白薇，</l>
<lb n="0702b03" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a10" ed="R110"/><l>各用四分煎五滾，<caesura/>服完六劑病能回。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0702b04" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a11" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾伍籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾伍籤</head>
<lb n="0702b05" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a12" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702b0501" type="regular"><l>茯苓枳<g ref="#CB16054"/>共焦查，<caesura/>竹葉燈心泡作茶，</l>
<lb n="0702b06" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a13" ed="R110"/><l>分兩休多各錢半，<caesura/>誠稱聖號病當瘥。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0702b07" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a14" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾陸籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾陸籤</head>
<lb n="0702b08" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a15" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702b0801" type="regular"><l>梹榔草蔻小青皮，<caesura/>鱉甲青蒿參草芪，</l>
<lb n="0702b09" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a16" ed="R110"/><l>各用五分薑棗引，<caesura/>三枚煎服病能離。</l></lg>
<lb n="0702b10" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a17" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0702b1001" style="margin-left:2em">持往生呪壹百零八遍，放生二千條。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0702b11" ed="X"/><lb n="0454a18" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾柒籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾柒籤</head>
<lb n="0702b12" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b01" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702b1201" type="regular"><l>桂枝川斷竝當歸，<caesura/>杜仲三錢少白薇，</l>
<lb n="0702b13" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b02" ed="R110"/><l>七箇桑枝一盃酒，<caesura/>如方十服病能推。</l></lg>
<lb n="0702b14" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b03" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0702b1401" style="margin-left:2em">每天請觀音聖號壹百零八遍。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0702b15" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b04" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾捌籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾捌籤</head>
<lb n="0702b16" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b05" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702b1601" type="regular"><l>防風荊芥共黃芩，<caesura/>薄荷相兼赤茯苓，</l>
<lb n="0702b17" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b06" ed="R110"/><l>各用五分須竹茹，<caesura/>服完三劑病能痊。</l></lg>
<lb n="0702b18" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b07" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0702b1801" style="margin-left:2em">代病人速向佛前懺悔壹百零八遍。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0702b19" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b08" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾玖籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾玖籤</head>
<lb n="0702b20" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b09" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702b2001" type="regular"><l>木香扁豆與山查，<caesura/>白芷靈仙有木瓜，</l>
<lb n="0702b21" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b10" ed="R110"/><l>香附三錢葱作引，<caesura/>服完能變體無瑕。</l></lg>
<lb n="0702b22" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b11" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0702b2201" style="margin-left:2em">每天發願，持大悲呪二十一遍，共四十天。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0702b23" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b12" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾籤</head>
<lb n="0702b24" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b13" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702b2401" type="regular"><l>使君鶴虱有烏梅，<caesura/>各用三錢病可回，</l>
<pb n="0702c" ed="X" xml:id="X62.1204.0702c"/>
<lb n="0702c01" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b14" ed="R110"/><l>須用長流水煎服，<caesura/>病人謹記怕春雷。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0702c02" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b15" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾壹籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾壹籤</head>
<lb n="0702c03" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b16" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702c0301" type="regular"><l>杜仲靈仙虎骨膠，<caesura/>白通草共嫩桑條，</l>
<lb n="0702c04" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b17" ed="R110"/><l>各用一錢加乳沒，<caesura/>亦須速望業冤消。</l></lg>
<lb n="0702c05" ed="X"/><lb n="0454b18" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0702c0501" style="margin-left:2em">誦佛號十萬聲，諷彌陀經貳百卷。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0702c06" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a01" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾貳籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾貳籤</head>
<lb n="0702c07" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a02" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702c0701" type="regular"><l>猪肺肝心各一具，<caesura/>加上菖蒲和竹茹，</l>
<lb n="0702c08" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a03" ed="R110"/><l>各用八分煎得熱，<caesura/>分為十次飲下肚。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0702c09" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a04" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾參籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾參籤</head>
<lb n="0702c10" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a05" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702c1001" type="regular"><l>蒼耳子共草河車，<caesura/>薄荷荊芥猪骨髓，</l>
<lb n="0702c11" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a06" ed="R110"/><l>各用一錢煎五滾，<caesura/>誠稱聖號可春回。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0702c12" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a07" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾肆籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾肆籤</head>
<lb n="0702c13" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a08" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702c1301" type="regular"><l>白蘚皮共淨連翹，<caesura/>藿梗蟬衣白菊牢，</l>
<lb n="0702c14" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a09" ed="R110"/><l>各配一錢加竹茹，<caesura/>服完五劑病能消。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0702c15" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a10" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾伍籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾伍籤</head>
<lb n="0702c16" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a11" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702c1601" type="regular"><l>參芩、白朮一方全，<caesura/>加上薏仁酸棗連，</l>
<lb n="0702c17" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a12" ed="R110"/><l>煎服須兼薑二片，<caesura/>誠心常服可能痊。</l></lg>
<lb n="0702c18" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a13" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0702c1801" style="margin-left:2em">念佛懺悔，早晚五串珠，懺悔九遍。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0702c19" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a14" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾陸籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾陸籤</head>
<lb n="0702c20" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a15" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702c2001" type="regular"><l>薺苨相與栢子仁，<caesura/>竝用辰砂染茯神，</l>
<lb n="0702c21" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a16" ed="R110"/><l>鱉甲青蒿各錢半，<caesura/>奇功此用可能成。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0702c22" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a17" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾柒籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾柒籤</head>
<lb n="0702c23" ed="X"/><lb n="0455a18" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0702c2301" type="regular"><l>歡絡經年要用殘，<caesura/>一杯苦酒共煎含，</l>
<lb n="0702c24" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b01" ed="R110"/><l>擇於寅時空心服，<caesura/>疼痛將來換笑顏。</l></lg></cb:div>
<pb n="0703a" ed="X" xml:id="X62.1204.0703a"/>
<lb n="0703a01" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b02" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾捌籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾捌籤</head>
<lb n="0703a02" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b03" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703a0201" type="regular"><l>青礞石共陳膽星，<caesura/>每用四分加金銀，</l>
<lb n="0703a03" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b04" ed="R110"/><l>竹茹菖蒲同少許，<caesura/>如方煎服病能輕。</l></lg>
<lb n="0703a04" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b05" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0703a0401" style="margin-left:2em">每天念佛千聲，諷《彌陀經》三卷，三月。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0703a05" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b06" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾玖籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾玖籤</head>
<lb n="0703a06" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b07" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703a0601" type="regular"><l>三稜莪朮共紅花，<caesura/>各用五錢加木瓜，</l>
<lb n="0703a07" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b08" ed="R110"/><l>研末為丸水法妙，<caesura/>每天一盞病除芽。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0703a08" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b09" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾籤</head>
<lb n="0703a09" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b10" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703a0901" type="regular"><l>青皮草果共陳皮，<caesura/>半夏一錢效稱奇，</l>
<lb n="0703a10" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b11" ed="R110"/><l>官桂木香水煎服。<caesura/>多年古疾一朝離。</l>
<lb n="0703a11" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b12" ed="R110"/><l>每藥各用錢半。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0703a12" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b13" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾壹籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾壹籤</head>
<lb n="0703a13" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b14" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703a1301" type="regular"><l>枳實用三分，<caesura/>陳皮栢子仁，</l>
<lb n="0703a14" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b15" ed="R110"/><l>煎湯各錢半，<caesura/>誠服必通神。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0703a15" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b16" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾貳籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾貳籤</head>
<lb n="0703a16" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b17" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703a1601" type="regular"><l>腹皮枳壳共鈎籐，<caesura/>白朮元參薏苡仁，</l>
<lb n="0703a17" ed="X"/><lb n="0455b18" ed="R110"/><l>各用一錢薑作引，<caesura/>服之得效望回春。</l></lg>
<lb n="0703a18" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a01" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0703a1801" style="margin-left:2em">誦佛五萬聲，《彌陀經》四十八卷。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0703a19" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a02" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾參籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾參籤</head>
<lb n="0703a20" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a03" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703a2001" type="regular"><l>海南沉香用八分，<caesura/>開水磨沖配完成，</l>
<lb n="0703a21" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a04" ed="R110"/><l>橘葉煎湯和服下，<caesura/>病證難痊可止疼。</l></lg>
<lb n="0703a22" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a05" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0703a2201" style="margin-left:2em">業冤甚重，速宜懺悔解釋，多念佛號。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0703a23" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a06" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾肆籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾肆籤</head>
<lb n="0703a24" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a07" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703a2401" type="regular"><l>製軍熟地各三錢，<caesura/>白朮沙參貝母全，</l>
<pb n="0703b" ed="X" xml:id="X62.1204.0703b"/>
<lb n="0703b01" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a08" ed="R110"/><l>若遇吐紅諸勞氣，<caesura/>二錢一服可除根。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0703b02" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a09" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾伍籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾伍籤</head>
<lb n="0703b03" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a10" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703b0301" type="regular"><l>荷梗辛夷綠升麻，<caesura/>每用三錢最可誇，</l>
<lb n="0703b04" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a11" ed="R110"/><l>寄語求方諸善士，<caesura/>此方服下即能瘥。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0703b05" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a12" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾陸籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾陸籤</head>
<lb n="0703b06" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a13" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703b0601" type="regular"><l>無底之舟用甚修，<caesura/>木香一塊水東流，</l>
<lb n="0703b07" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a14" ed="R110"/><l>同煎服下能消動，<caesura/>此疾經年可望收。</l></lg>
<lb n="0703b08" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a15" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0703b0801" style="margin-left:2em">速懺悔多生業障，多放生靈。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0703b09" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a16" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾柒籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾柒籤</head>
<lb n="0703b10" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a17" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703b1001" type="regular"><l>白芷防風蒼耳草，<caesura/>各用二錢同國老，</l>
<lb n="0703b11" ed="X"/><lb n="0456a18" ed="R110"/><l>飴糖貝母各二錢，<caesura/>證屬險候難全好。</l></lg>
<lb n="0703b12" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b01" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0703b1201" style="margin-left:2em">拂除俗事，默佛蒲團。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0703b13" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b02" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾捌籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾捌籤</head>
<lb n="0703b14" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b03" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703b1401" type="regular"><l>芝皮秦皮黑豆皮，<caesura/>桑皮更用五加皮，</l>
<lb n="0703b15" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b04" ed="R110"/><l>薑皮各用五錢半，<caesura/>得愈之時方見奇。</l></lg>
<lb n="0703b16" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b05" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0703b1601" style="margin-left:2em">每日發願持大悲呪二十一遍。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0703b17" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b06" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾玖籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾玖籤</head>
<lb n="0703b18" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b07" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703b1801" type="regular"><l>黨參三錢要細紋，<caesura/>蘇葉二錢共合成，</l>
<lb n="0703b19" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b08" ed="R110"/><l>煎服如薑汁和蜜，<caesura/><g ref="#CB05418"/>誠捧服效如神。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0703b20" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b09" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾籤</head>
<lb n="0703b21" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b10" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703b2101" type="regular"><l>木瓜梹榔四分，<caesura/>棗薑三箇完成，</l>
<lb n="0703b22" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b11" ed="R110"/><l>臨服加入瓜酒，<caesura/>能無冤業纏身。</l></lg>
<lb n="0703b23" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b12" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0703b2301" style="margin-left:2em">佛號念四十八萬，解劫呪壹千貳百遍，放生命
<lb n="0703b24" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b13" ed="R110"/>五千條。</p></cb:div>
<pb n="0703c" ed="X" xml:id="X62.1204.0703c"/>
<lb n="0703c01" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b14" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾壹籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾壹籤</head>
<lb n="0703c02" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b15" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703c0201" type="regular"><l>彌陀為丸，<caesura/>放生為引，</l>
<lb n="0703c03" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b16" ed="R110"/><l>九九作成，<caesura/>病離食傾。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0703c04" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b17" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾貳籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾貳籤</head>
<lb n="0703c05" ed="X"/><lb n="0456b18" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703c0501" type="regular"><l>爐內香<g ref="#CB01926"/>一撮，<caesura/>案前淨水一杯，</l>
<lb n="0703c06" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a01" ed="R110"/><l>煎服須要誠敬，<caesura/>此病難以全回。</l></lg>
<lb n="0703c07" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a02" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0703c0701" style="margin-left:2em">多生罪業，速宜念佛消除。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0703c08" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a03" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾參籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾參籤</head>
<lb n="0703c09" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a04" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703c0901" type="regular"><l>大香三根要三錢，<caesura/>東流菩提水中連，</l>
<lb n="0703c10" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a05" ed="R110"/><l>常喧佛號來煎服，<caesura/>業障深沉豈偶然。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0703c11" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a06" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾肆籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾肆籤</head>
<lb n="0703c12" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a07" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703c1201" type="regular"><l>乩盤砂子要三錢，<caesura/>臨服香<g ref="#CB01926"/>一撮煎，</l>
<lb n="0703c13" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a08" ed="R110"/><l>加上菩提水煎服，<caesura/>陰人休犯亦能痊。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0703c14" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a09" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾伍籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾伍籤</head>
<lb n="0703c15" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a10" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703c1501" type="regular"><l>拜熱腐草用二錢，<caesura/>七寸燈心十箇全，</l>
<lb n="0703c16" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a11" ed="R110"/><l>煎湯服下須忌口，<caesura/>管教患者笑連連。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0703c17" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a12" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾陸籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾陸籤</head>
<lb n="0703c18" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a13" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703c1801" type="regular"><l>荷梗葉邊用三錢，<caesura/>荷蒂相同七寸連，</l>
<lb n="0703c19" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a14" ed="R110"/><l>生地麥冬二錢半，<caesura/>寅時煎服病能痊。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0703c20" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a15" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾柒籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾柒籤</head>
<lb n="0703c21" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a16" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703c2101" type="regular"><l>橘皮竹茹共丁香，<caesura/>柿蒂如來惟最涼，</l>
<lb n="0703c22" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a17" ed="R110"/><l>每用二錢水煎服，<caesura/>照方三服病稱祥。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0703c23" ed="X"/><lb n="0457a18" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾捌籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾捌籤</head>
<lb n="0703c24" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b01" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0703c2401" type="regular"><l>四物湯加遠志仁，<caesura/>佩蘭鱉甲牡犡粉，</l>
<pb n="0704a" ed="X" xml:id="X62.1204.0704a"/>
<lb n="0704a01" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b02" ed="R110"/><l>各配二錢加肉桂，<caesura/>照方服下莫勞神。</l>
<lb n="0704a02" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b03" ed="R110"/><l>宜趺坐調出入氣。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704a03" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b04" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">罰籤方</cb:mulu><head>罰籤方</head>
<lb n="0704a04" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b05" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704a0401" type="regular"><l>求方來意不誠，<caesura/>藥餌如何通神？</l>
<lb n="0704a05" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b06" ed="R110"/><l>罰出香油筋半，<caesura/>道場供養佛燈。</l></lg>
<lb n="0704a06" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b07" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0704a0601" style="margin-left:2em">明天正心誠意再求，今日不發。</p></cb:div></cb:div>
<lb n="0704a07" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b08" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="2" type="其他">外證籤方</cb:mulu><head>外證籤方</head>
<lb n="0704a08" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b09" ed="R110"/><p xml:id="pX62p0704a0801" style="margin-left:2em">外證。凡來求方者，先在佛前許願，領佛圖一張，
<lb n="0704a09" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b10" ed="R110"/>念佛四十八萬，少者四萬八千，再次者四千八
<lb n="0704a10" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b11" ed="R110"/>百聲，將佛圖圈滿，上寫代一切恩冤情識迴向
<lb n="0704a11" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b12" ed="R110"/>西方。此圖在佛前焚化，若果<g ref="#CB05418"/>誠，自有感應。</p>
<lb n="0704a12" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b13" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第壹籤</cb:mulu><head>第壹籤</head>
<lb n="0704a13" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b14" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704a1301" type="regular"><l>獨活共南星，<caesura/>研末兩和勻，</l>
<lb n="0704a14" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b15" ed="R110"/><l><g ref="#CB06398"/>頭調敷好，<caesura/>腫毒見此靈。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704a15" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b16" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳籤</head>
<lb n="0704a16" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b17" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704a1601" type="regular"><l>甘石寒水石，</l>
<lb n="0704a17" ed="X"/><lb n="0457b18" ed="R110"/><l>研末敷三日。</l></lg><p xml:id="pX62p0704a1706" style="margin-left:2em" cb:place="inline">麻油調。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0704a18" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a01" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參籤</cb:mulu><head>第參籤</head>
<lb n="0704a19" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a02" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704a1901" type="regular"><l>紅花與木瓜，<caesura/>研末麝香加，</l>
<lb n="0704a20" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a03" ed="R110"/><l>醋蜜調和好，<caesura/>外證遇此瘥。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704a21" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a04" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆籤</head>
<lb n="0704a22" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a05" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704a2201"><l>蒼耳果要鮮，<caesura/>搗敷病可痊。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704a23" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a06" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第伍籤</cb:mulu><head>第伍籤</head>
<lb n="0704a24" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a07" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704a2401"><l>馬鞭鮮草葉，<caesura/>患人腫上貼。</l></lg></cb:div>
<pb n="0704b" ed="X" xml:id="X62.1204.0704b"/>
<lb n="0704b01" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a08" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第陸籤</cb:mulu><head>第陸籤</head>
<lb n="0704b02" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a09" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704b0201" type="regular"><l>千人脚下泥，<caesura/><g ref="#CB06398"/>頭同搗勻，</l>
<lb n="0704b03" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a10" ed="R110"/><l>患者敷一宿，<caesura/>洗去病如擒。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704b04" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a11" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第柒籤</cb:mulu><head>第柒籤</head>
<lb n="0704b05" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a12" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704b0501"><l>陳挂絡子香，<caesura/>蔴油共栽培。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704b06" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a13" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第捌籤</cb:mulu><head>第捌籤</head>
<lb n="0704b07" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a14" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704b0701" type="regular"><l>桃丹與石膏。</l>
<lb n="0704b08" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a15" ed="R110"/><l>油敷病可撓。</l></lg><p xml:id="pX62p0704b0806" style="margin-left:2em" cb:place="inline">每用三錢。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0704b09" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a16" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第玖籤</cb:mulu><head>第玖籤</head>
<lb n="0704b10" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a17" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704b1001" type="regular"><l>黃連竝黃栢，<caesura/>研末二錢足，</l>
<lb n="0704b11" ed="X"/><lb n="0458a18" ed="R110"/><l>水蜜調勻合，<caesura/>同敷腫上肉。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704b12" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b01" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾籤</head>
<lb n="0704b13" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b02" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704b1301" type="regular"><l>神前<note n="0704b1301" resp="CBETA" type="add">蠟【CB】，臘【卍續】</note><app n="0704b1301"><lem resp="CBETA.maha" wit="【CB】">蠟</lem><rdg wit="【卍續】">臘</rdg></app>燭油。</l>
<lb n="0704b14" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b03" ed="R110"/><l>敷之病可瘥。</l></lg><p xml:id="pX62p0704b1406" style="margin-left:2em" cb:place="inline">晝夜一換。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0704b15" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b04" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾壹籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾壹籤</head>
<lb n="0704b16" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b05" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704b1601" type="regular"><l>紫甘蔗皮，<caesura/>燒<g ref="#CB01926"/>存性，</l>
<lb n="0704b17" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b06" ed="R110"/><l><g ref="#CB15444"/>油調勻，<caesura/>可能却病。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704b18" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b07" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾貳籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾貳籤</head>
<lb n="0704b19" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b08" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704b1901"><l>黃連膏三錢，<caesura/>敷之病可拈。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704b20" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b09" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾參籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾參籤</head>
<lb n="0704b21" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b10" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704b2101"><l>真君妙貼散，<caesura/>三錢水蜜調。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704b22" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b11" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾肆籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾肆籤</head>
<lb n="0704b23" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b12" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704b2301" type="regular"><l>大楓肉五個，<caesura/>麻油要一杯，</l>
<lb n="0704b24" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b13" ed="R110"/><l>同煎兩三滾，<caesura/>敷之病可回。</l></lg></cb:div>
<pb n="0704c" ed="X" xml:id="X62.1204.0704c"/>
<lb n="0704c01" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b14" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾伍籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾伍籤</head>
<lb n="0704c02" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b15" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704c0201"><l>梨皮二三片，<caesura/>腫消可立見。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704c03" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b16" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾陸籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾陸籤</head>
<lb n="0704c04" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b17" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704c0401"><l>死鯽魚麝香，<caesura/>搗敷病可良。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704c05" ed="X"/><lb n="0458b18" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾柒籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾柒籤</head>
<lb n="0704c06" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a01" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704c0601"><l>鷄蛋水粉漿，<caesura/>調敷保安康。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704c07" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a02" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾捌籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾捌籤</head>
<lb n="0704c08" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a03" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704c0801" type="regular"><l>蜈蚣焙成<g ref="#CB01926"/>，<caesura/>全蠍兩三枚，</l>
<lb n="0704c09" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a04" ed="R110"/><l>研末水敷好，<caesura/>腫消病可回。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704c10" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a05" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾玖籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾玖籤</head>
<lb n="0704c11" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a06" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704c1101"><l>老松樹皮麤，<caesura/>搗爛如泥敷。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704c12" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a07" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾籤</head>
<lb n="0704c13" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a08" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704c1301" type="regular"><l>豆腐壹塊，<caesura/>硫黃五分，</l>
<lb n="0704c14" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a09" ed="R110"/><l>同煎數滾，<caesura/>敷上功成。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704c15" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a10" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾壹籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾壹籤</head>
<lb n="0704c16" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a11" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704c1601"><l>黃參一錢十日搽，<caesura/>膏藥葢之患可瘥。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704c17" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a12" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾貳籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾貳籤</head>
<lb n="0704c18" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a13" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704c1801"><l>拜墊草燒<g ref="#CB01926"/>，<caesura/>麻油敷病回。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704c19" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a14" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾參籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾參籤</head>
<lb n="0704c20" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a15" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704c2001" type="regular"><l>望月砂三錢，</l>
<lb n="0704c21" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a16" ed="R110"/><l>研末涼水調。</l></lg><p xml:id="pX62p0704c2106" style="margin-left:2em" cb:place="inline">敷過，取舊綢裹好。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0704c22" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a17" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾肆籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾肆籤</head>
<lb n="0704c23" ed="X"/><lb n="0459a18" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0704c2301"><l>線香十根研末，<caesura/>涼水調敷腫毒。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0704c24" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b01" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾伍籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾伍籤</head>
<pb n="0705a" ed="X" xml:id="X62.1204.0705a"/>
<lb n="0705a01" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b02" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705a0101"><l>鹽滷與炒米，<caesura/>搗敷病立起。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705a02" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b03" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾陸籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾陸籤</head>
<lb n="0705a03" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b04" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705a0301"><l>麝香冰片研細末，<caesura/>每用二分用手撮。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705a04" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b05" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾柒籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾柒籤</head>
<lb n="0705a05" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b06" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705a0501"><l>沖和散五錢，<caesura/><g ref="#CB06398"/>蜜敷病痊。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705a06" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b07" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第貳拾捌籤</cb:mulu><head>第貳拾捌籤</head>
<lb n="0705a07" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b08" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705a0701"><l>上肉桂一錢，<caesura/>研末用膏貼。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705a08" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b09" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第拾貳玖籤</cb:mulu><head>第拾貳玖籤</head>
<lb n="0705a09" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b10" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705a0901"><l>葱艾各壹兩，<caesura/>煎湯薰洗好。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705a10" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b11" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾籤</head>
<lb n="0705a11" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b12" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705a1101"><l>蛇床共苦參，<caesura/>煎湯洗住疼。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705a12" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b13" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾壹籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾壹籤</head>
<lb n="0705a13" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b14" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705a1301"><l>炮甲片二錢，<caesura/>研末搽自全。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705a14" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b15" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾貳籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾貳籤</head>
<lb n="0705a15" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b16" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705a1501" type="regular"><l>血竭與木瓜，<caesura/>二錢研末加，</l>
<lb n="0705a16" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b17" ed="R110"/><l>瓜酒調敷好，<caesura/>何患病不瘥。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705a17" ed="X"/><lb n="0459b18" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾參籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾參籤</head>
<lb n="0705a18" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a01" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705a1801"><l>象皮具母末，<caesura/>搽之可立奪。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705a19" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a02" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾肆籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾肆籤</head>
<lb n="0705a20" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a03" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705a2001"><l>松香與醋搗，<caesura/>敷之病可好。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705a21" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a04" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾伍籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾伍籤</head>
<lb n="0705a22" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a05" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705a2201" type="regular"><l>生大黃壹兩，</l>
<lb n="0705a23" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a06" ed="R110"/><l>研末敷腫上。</l></lg><p xml:id="pX62p0705a2306" style="margin-left:2em" cb:place="inline">冷水調，綢包好。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0705a24" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a07" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參肆陸籤</cb:mulu><head>第參肆陸籤</head>
<pb n="0705b" ed="X" xml:id="X62.1204.0705b"/>
<lb n="0705b01" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a08" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705b0101"><l>乳香共末藥，<caesura/>搽之疤可落。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705b02" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a09" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾柒籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾柒籤</head>
<lb n="0705b03" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a10" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705b0301"><l>銀硃用二錢，<caesura/>醋調敷自痊。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705b04" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a11" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參拾捌籤</cb:mulu><head>第參拾捌籤</head>
<lb n="0705b05" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a12" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705b0501"><l>真硃共琥珀，<caesura/>研末能去毒。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705b06" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a13" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第參肆玖籤</cb:mulu><head>第參肆玖籤</head>
<lb n="0705b07" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a14" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705b0701" type="regular"><l>浮小麥三錢，</l>
<lb n="0705b08" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a15" ed="R110"/><l>研末溫水敷。</l></lg><p xml:id="pX62p0705b0806" style="margin-left:2em" cb:place="inline">放患處，用皮紙葢上，綢札。</p></cb:div>
<lb n="0705b09" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a16" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾籤</head>
<lb n="0705b10" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a17" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705b1001"><l>蟾酥二錢研末，<caesura/>菊花汁水調敷。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705b11" ed="X"/><lb n="0460a18" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾壹籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾壹籤</head>
<lb n="0705b12" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b01" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705b1201"><l>萬靈丹一副，<caesura/>服之病可除。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705b13" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b02" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾貳籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾貳籤</head>
<lb n="0705b14" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b03" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705b1401"><l>琥珀丸七粒，<caesura/>服之能愈疾。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705b15" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b04" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾參籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾參籤</head>
<lb n="0705b16" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b05" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705b1601"><l>牡糲研末，<caesura/>瓜酒沖服。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705b17" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b06" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾肆籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾肆籤</head>
<lb n="0705b18" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b07" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705b1801"><l>防風通聖丸，<caesura/>三錢病可痊。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705b19" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b08" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾伍籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾伍籤</head>
<lb n="0705b20" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b09" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705b2001" type="regular"><l>嫩桑枝七個，<caesura/>葱頭放三根。</l>
<lb n="0705b21" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b10" ed="R110"/><l>煎湯服三劑，<caesura/>此病可除根。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705b22" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b11" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾陸籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾陸籤</head>
<lb n="0705b23" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b12" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705b2301"><l>小粉漿二錢，<caesura/>滴醋同調敷。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705b24" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b13" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾柒籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾柒籤</head>
<pb n="0705c" ed="X" xml:id="X62.1204.0705c"/>
<lb n="0705c01" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b14" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705c0101"><l>冰片和死鯽魚腦，<caesura/>搗敷如泥證可好。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705c02" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b15" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">第肆拾捌籤</cb:mulu><head>第肆拾捌籤</head>
<lb n="0705c03" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b16" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705c0301" type="regular"><l>乩砂一撮，<caesura/>香<g ref="#CB01926"/>壹兩，</l>
<lb n="0705c04" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b17" ed="R110"/><l>醋蜜調敷，<caesura/>效如影響。</l></lg></cb:div>
<lb n="0705c05" ed="X"/><lb n="0460b18" ed="R110"/><cb:div type="other"><cb:mulu level="3" type="其他">罰籤</cb:mulu><head>罰籤</head>
<lb n="0705c06" ed="X"/><lb n="0461a01" ed="R110"/><lg xml:id="lgX62p0705c0601" type="regular"><l>求方要誠心，<caesura/>不誠何能靈？</l>
<lb n="0705c07" ed="X"/><lb n="0461a02" ed="R110"/><l>大香罰斤半，<caesura/><note n="0705c0701" resp="CBETA" type="add">蠟【CB】，臘【卍續】</note><app n="0705c0701"><lem resp="CBETA.maha" wit="【CB】">蠟</lem><rdg wit="【卍續】">臘</rdg></app>燭共一斤。</l></lg></cb:div></cb:div></cb:div>
<lb n="0705c08" ed="X"/><lb n="0461a03" ed="R110"/>
<lb n="0705c09" ed="X"/><lb n="0461a04" ed="R110"/><cb:juan n="5" fun="close"><cb:jhead>蓮修起信錄卷第五</cb:jhead></cb:juan>
</body></text></TEI>